  "Disco y más": ["Disco and more", "Disco et plus encore"],
  "Ceremonia y certificado de grado al culminar el programa.": ["Graduation ceremony and certificate on completing the programme.", "Cérémonie et certificat de fin de programme."],
  "Oundle / Rugby / York / Uppingham": ["Oundle / Rugby / York / Uppingham", "Oundle / Rugby / York / Uppingham"],
